{"meta":{"id":"fetch-response","category":"it/syntax/typescript/network","title":"fetch 와 응답 타입 · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"fetch 응답을 ApiResponse<T> 제네릭으로 타입 지정, res.ok 확인, POST","tags":["typescript","f-network","f-generic"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">fetch 와 응답 타입 · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> fetch 응답을 ApiResponse&lt;T&gt; 제네릭으로 타입 지정, res.ok 확인, POST</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">fetch 와 응답 타입</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">interface User { id: number; name: string }\r\n\r\ninterface ApiResponse&lt;T&gt; {\r\n  success: boolean;\r\n  data: T;\r\n  message?: string;\r\n}\r\n\r\nasync function getUser(id: number): Promise&lt;User&gt; {\r\n  const res = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`);\r\n  if (!res.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${res.status}`);   // fetch 는 4xx/5xx 에서 reject 하지 않음\r\n\r\n  const body: ApiResponse&lt;User&gt; = await res.json();     // json() 은 any → 타입 지정\r\n  return body.data;\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>res.json()</code> 의 결과는 실행 시점에 검사되지 않는다. 타입은 \"이런 형태일 것\" 이라는 약속일 뿐이므로 중요한 데이터는 런타임 검증(zod 등)을 함께 쓴다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">POST</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">async function createUser(input: Omit&lt;User, &quot;id&quot;&gt;): Promise&lt;User&gt; {\r\n  const res = await fetch(&quot;/api/users&quot;, {\r\n    method: &quot;POST&quot;,\r\n    headers: { &quot;Content-Type&quot;: &quot;application/json&quot; },\r\n    body: JSON.stringify(input),\r\n  });\r\n  return (await res.json()).data;\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> 함수 › 제네릭, 컴파일 › 실행 시점에도 영향을 주는 문법</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/network/fetch-response","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"network","title":"통신","path":"it/syntax/typescript/network"}],"hasImage":false}